The remaining ~100 lines are spread over smaller contributors.

Caveats:
- The counts include non-code files (README, HISTORY.md, CI configs, `package.json`) and test files. Most of the lines are in `test/test.js`. For ownership of library code only, run the same blame on `lib/index.js`.
- Blame credits the last author to touch a line. A line that was lightly edited, for example by a lint or style change, moves to the editor. This can undercount original authors.
- The same commit-author name can appear under different emails. I grouped by name only, so one person with two names would show as two rows.

